<title>USA: Empi says names Patrick Spangler CFO.</title>
<headline>Empi says names Patrick Spangler CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAINT PAUL, Minn. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Empi Inc said it appointed Patrick Spangler chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Spangler will join the company on July 14, said the medical device maker.</p>
<p>He was formerly a financial executive at Medtronic Inc, Empi said.  </p>
<p>Spangler replaces Timothy Briggs, who resigned in February to pursue other options.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
